# GitHub YAML is hand-wrapped for readability (folded `if:` conditions, one
# condition per line). Prettier's reflow is semantically a no-op here but
# destroys that structure, so these stay out of the formatter's scope.
.github/workflows
.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE

# Generated by fumadocs-mdx on postinstall and gitignored — checking it only
# produces noise in `format:check`.
apps/docs/.source

# lerna-lite re-serialises this whole file on every release bump (expanding the
# `packages` array multi-line) in a format prettier disagrees with, and the tool
# wins again on the very next bump — so format-checking it only turns the lint
# gate red on each `chore(release):` commit without ever staying green.
lerna.json

# CSS-module type stubs generated by vite-plugin-sass-dts (`build:scss-types`).
# Unlike the repo's own generators, the plugin owns their Prettier formatting, so
# a sass-dts or Prettier version bump could make format:check start fighting the
# generator over files it already formats. They're pure generated artifacts —
# keep them out of the format gate.
**/*.module.d.scss.ts
